# Bot1 declines the counters on the entering Ornithopter: a 1/1 white Spirit token (X=1) is created instead; the token entering does not trigger the Warden again (it is a token).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Warden of the Grove
Ornithopter
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Warden of the Grove.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Decline
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Spirit Token.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Spirit Token.Colors = White
